Fonts
-----

The UI font stack prefers "HCo Gotham" when available, with system UI /
sans-serif fallbacks. Proprietary Gotham font binaries are NOT distributed
in this repository. Supply licensed font files privately at deploy time if
you need Gotham rendering.
